%% Routing Decision Matrix
flowchart TD
    In[Score Aggregator Output] --> S{Severity Class?}
    S -- SEVERE --> SS{Confidence?}
    SS -- High --> RM1[Auto-Remove<br/>+ NCMEC if CSAM]
    SS -- Borderline --> RM2[Auto-Remove<br/>+ Spot-Check Flag]
    SS -- Low --> H0[Human Review<br/>P0: 5 min SLA]

    S -- HARMFUL --> HS{Confidence?}
    HS -- High --> RM3[Auto-Remove]
    HS -- Borderline --> H1[Human Review<br/>P1: 30 min SLA]
    HS -- Low --> AP1[Auto-Approve]

    S -- BORDERLINE --> BS{Confidence?}
    BS -- High --> H2[Human Review<br/>P2: 4 hr SLA]
    BS -- Borderline --> H2
    BS -- Low --> AP2[Auto-Approve]

    S -- SAFE --> AP3[Auto-Approve]
